{
	"name": "Botanical Brigand",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/nature/barrier-shield-wood-vines.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 18th level, you gain the following abilities:</p><h2>Immovable Taproot</h2><p>Your roots run deep and true. When you are under the effects of your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.nbVWDg8biohDUzBS]{Rooted in Earth} feature, you are immune to being shoved or knocked prone, and your movement Speed is no longer halved as a result of this feature.</p><h2>Photosynthesis</h2><p>So long as you are above ground and able to be in direct exposure to the sun for more than 4 hours, you do not need to consume Supply for that day.</p><h2>Piercing Barricade</h2><p>Your connection to the plants and the soil enables you to summon plants to your aid in battle. Once per long rest you may cast the spell @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.m68wvspmjjd2aaat]{Wall of Thorns} without expending a spell slot or requiring material components. Intelligence is your spellcasting modifier for this spell.</p>",
